WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.310 --> 00:00:02.299
- Okay, all right,

00:00:02.299 --> 00:00:03.140
(thud)

00:00:03.140 --> 00:00:05.153
Good morning Tom, Jason.

00:00:06.220 --> 00:00:08.450
How you doin' there Dave, Crystal?

00:00:08.450 --> 00:00:09.510
Tommy.

00:00:09.510 --> 00:00:10.820
Good morning, Jake.

00:00:10.820 --> 00:00:12.260
How are ya?

00:00:12.260 --> 00:00:13.250
- Pretty good, Kenny.

00:00:13.250 --> 00:00:14.770
- Yeah, yeah.

00:00:14.770 --> 00:00:16.060
You know it's so early in the morning.

00:00:16.060 --> 00:00:18.330
I'm sorry to be the bearer of bad news.

00:00:18.330 --> 00:00:21.630
But you know how I was
supposed to work late tonight?

00:00:21.630 --> 00:00:22.463
- [Jake] Uh hm.

00:00:22.463 --> 00:00:24.720
- Well I gotta run this
errand for Mr. Mahina.

00:00:24.720 --> 00:00:26.580
And he says that you're
gonna have to cover for me.

00:00:26.580 --> 00:00:27.420
So there it is.

00:00:27.420 --> 00:00:28.690
I don't need, I'm sorry (whistles),

00:00:28.690 --> 00:00:30.310
drop the ax. (laughs)

00:00:30.310 --> 00:00:31.680
Okay, so.

00:00:31.680 --> 00:00:34.670
- Hm, again.

00:00:34.670 --> 00:00:35.693
- Yeah, so.

00:00:36.880 --> 00:00:37.728
Oh, you know what,

00:00:37.728 --> 00:00:39.620
(snap) just remembered (laughs),

00:00:39.620 --> 00:00:42.440
Mr. Mahina also, almost slipped my mind,

00:00:42.440 --> 00:00:44.626
wants us to change parking spaces.

00:00:44.626 --> 00:00:45.580
- What?

00:00:45.580 --> 00:00:46.413
- Yeah.

00:00:46.413 --> 00:00:49.380
Me, personally, I enjoy
the nine minute walk.

00:00:49.380 --> 00:00:51.440
But he said that we have to do it.

00:00:51.440 --> 00:00:53.778
Believe it, I hate it as much as you do.

00:00:53.778 --> 00:00:54.910
- What are you gonna do?

00:00:54.910 --> 00:00:55.743
- Nothing you can do.

00:00:55.743 --> 00:00:56.750
- Mr. Mahina said it.

00:00:56.750 --> 00:00:58.100
- Mahina.

00:00:58.100 --> 00:01:00.040
This whole situation has been Mahinanized.

00:01:00.040 --> 00:01:02.300
- It just seems a little confusing to me

00:01:02.300 --> 00:01:05.740
as to why Mr. Mahina would give a fuck

00:01:05.740 --> 00:01:07.550
where we park.

00:01:07.550 --> 00:01:08.420
- How's that?

00:01:08.420 --> 00:01:12.260
- I mean why would he care where we park?

00:01:12.260 --> 00:01:13.950
- I don't know the
answer to that question.

00:01:13.950 --> 00:01:15.280
I mean that's, it's just what he said.

00:01:15.280 --> 00:01:17.470
Hey, the Mahina works in mysterious ways.

00:01:17.470 --> 00:01:18.303
- You know what?

00:01:18.303 --> 00:01:19.350
I'm gonna ask him myself, 'cause--

00:01:19.350 --> 00:01:20.275
- No, that's okay!

00:01:20.275 --> 00:01:21.192
I'll do it!

00:01:26.462 --> 00:01:28.240
(door slamming)

00:01:28.240 --> 00:01:29.720
Uh Mr. Mahina sir, I know you're busy.

00:01:29.720 --> 00:01:32.400
But can I speak to you
about the parking switch?

00:01:32.400 --> 00:01:34.180
- [Mr. Mahina] What is
there to talk about Kenny?

00:01:34.180 --> 00:01:37.308
I told you and Jake to
switch parking spaces.

00:01:37.308 --> 00:01:38.793
Don't you know who I am?

00:01:38.793 --> 00:01:43.600
I am Mr. Mahina and I'm a
real, real person in here.

00:01:43.600 --> 00:01:46.443
Now you get the hell out of my office.

00:01:49.932 --> 00:01:50.765
- Wow.
(thud)

00:01:50.765 --> 00:01:51.598
Did you hear that?

00:01:51.598 --> 00:01:52.431
It was crazy in there.

00:01:52.431 --> 00:01:54.920
I mean that was, phew, intense.

00:01:54.920 --> 00:01:56.520
- Yeah.

00:01:56.520 --> 00:01:58.920
You know what's really crazy though?

00:01:58.920 --> 00:02:00.950
I been working here for about a year

00:02:00.950 --> 00:02:03.490
and I've never even seen Mr. Mahina.

00:02:03.490 --> 00:02:05.340
- Well see now, that's
an easy one to answer.

00:02:05.340 --> 00:02:07.210
That's because he comes in
before you come into work

00:02:07.210 --> 00:02:08.430
and he's still working when you leave.

00:02:08.430 --> 00:02:09.810
That's what makes him Mr. Mahina.

00:02:09.810 --> 00:02:11.969
Come on, we're talking about
Mr. Mahina here, right?

00:02:11.969 --> 00:02:12.913
(both laugh)

00:02:12.913 --> 00:02:14.110
- That makes perfect sense.

00:02:14.110 --> 00:02:17.320
You know, I bet, the hard working boss

00:02:17.320 --> 00:02:20.980
would love to meet a
hard working employee,

00:02:20.980 --> 00:02:22.850
you know, shares the same values,

00:02:22.850 --> 00:02:25.708
so I'm gonna go ahead and
just introduce myself.

00:02:25.708 --> 00:02:26.563
- No, no!

00:02:27.970 --> 00:02:29.037
You can't go into Mr. Mahina's room.

00:02:29.037 --> 00:02:29.960
Are you crazy?

00:02:29.960 --> 00:02:31.240
No one except me is
allowed to go in there.

00:02:31.240 --> 00:02:32.533
Mr. Mahina is busy.

00:02:35.213 --> 00:02:36.046
(slap)

00:02:36.046 --> 00:02:38.510
- Okay, fine, you made
your point clear, man.

00:02:38.510 --> 00:02:39.880
- Thank you very much Jake.
- I'm good.

00:02:39.880 --> 00:02:40.713
- I think it's best,

00:02:40.713 --> 00:02:45.713
what, no, Jake, Jake!
(intense music)

00:02:48.010 --> 00:02:49.013
- Come on man.

00:02:51.140 --> 00:02:52.770
- [Mr. Mahina] What?

00:02:52.770 --> 00:02:55.889
Question my existence, will you?

00:02:55.889 --> 00:02:58.817
(screaming)

00:02:58.817 --> 00:03:00.226
(door slams)

00:03:00.226 --> 00:03:03.218
You will not just turn
me into a mop creature.

00:03:03.218 --> 00:03:04.051
It couldn't be that people--

00:03:04.051 --> 00:03:06.437
- I'll have that end of the
year report to you by 10.

